# REC held while playing, on a sound page: the knobs turn and are recorded (motion punched in, as keys punch in
# notes); let go, they no longer record. On Steps, REC held keeps the record settings; stopped, everywhere
wait 300
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
tap PLAY
wait 300
press REC
wait 20
shot recknob.png
spin K1 4
wait 260
spin K1 4
wait 260
spin K1 4
release REC
expect lane 2 1 e1 2
wait 200
spin K2 4
expect lane 2 1 e2 0
tap SEQ
expect page Steps
press REC
spin K3 -10
release REC
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
tap EDIT
press REC
spin K1 1
release REC
expect lane 2 1 e1 2
